{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55176","headline":"鸣山 · 罗衮","name":"鸣山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下名山有，未闻山自鸣。\n昂藏如许濶，尔何亦不平。\n（见同治丙寅刊齐召南等纂《温州府志》卷四《山川》。\n）（按：《宋诗纪事补遗》卷八八误收罗衮此诗入事迹无考作者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}